          <sense n="2"><hi rend="italic">ewig <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref></hi> woruld, ecnes, (butan) ende; libban ⁊ ricsian</sense>
          <sense n="3">fiat<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sic"><abbr>!</abbr></ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ubersetzend"><abbr>übsnd</abbr></ref>:</hi> si hit swa <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84,6; soð hit si <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ExcomVII">Excom VII</ref> 26; gewyrðe þæt <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ebenda"><abbr>ebd.</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiVII">Iud Dei VII</ref> 24,1 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:MsA">A</ref></sense>
          <sense n="4"><hi rend="italic">so Gott will:</hi> gif hit God wille <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 38</sense>
          <sense n="5">absit<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sic"><abbr>!</abbr></ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:glossirend"><abbr>glossirend</abbr></ref>:</hi> fearr <pb n="78"/>sie <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiIV">Iud Dei IV</ref> 22,2</sense>
          <sense n="6"><hi rend="italic">anredend:</hi> men þa leofestan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ExcomVII">Excom VII</ref> 1; <hi rend="italic">grüssend zu Anfang:</hi> gret freondlice <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref>,1. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:WiLad">Wl lad</ref> Pro. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Lond">Lond</ref> Pro; <hi rend="italic">zu Ende:</hi> God eow gehealde<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sic"><abbr>!</abbr></ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:WiLond">Wl Lond</ref> 5</sense>
          <sense n="7"><hi rend="italic">beteuernd <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="entry" target="entry:on">on</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Praeposition"><abbr>prp</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:D">D</ref> 2</sense>
          <sense n="8"><hi rend="italic">citirend <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref></hi> (<ref type="entry" target="entry:awritan">a</ref>)<ref type="entry" target="entry:writan">writan</ref>, <ref type="entry" target="entry:cwedan">cweðan</ref>, <ref type="entry" target="entry:secgan">secgan</ref></sense>
          <sense n="9"><hi rend="italic">ermahnend:</hi> gieme (understande) seþe wille (cunne) <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 26. (4,1)</sense>
          <sense n="10">(<hi rend="italic">ver</hi>)<hi rend="italic">ehrend:</hi> lufian ⁊ <ref type="entry" target="entry:weordian">weorðian</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> <hi rend="bold">F</hi>) <hi rend="italic">stilistische Phrasen:</hi> fela þinga ic getellan ne mæig <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 21,4 (<hi rend="italic">ähnlich</hi> 5,4. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 12. 16; gesecgan 18) <hi rend="bold">G</hi>) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref> <ref type="entry" target="entry:Sprichworter">Sprichwörter</ref></hi> <hi rend="bold">H</hi>) <hi rend="italic">sonstige:</hi> að ⁊ wedd (⁊ borgas <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAs">V As</ref> Pro 3) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> | clæne bæc habban <ref type="lawCode" target="law:AGu">AGu</ref> 5 | to gebeorge ⁊ friðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 12,1 | borgbryce ⁊ wedbryce <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 1,8 | cyning ⁊ ealle his frind <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 1,3 | cinges hand seald grið <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ECf">ECf</ref> 12 | corn ne sceaf <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 4 | crocca towalle <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 94,3a | feorh gefare ne geyrne <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 18 | friðian ⁊ nerian <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had</ref> 1,1 | began oððe bewitan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 3,1 | golde ne seolfre <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 8,1 | ge hades ge eardes (eðles) þolian <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 26 (<ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 41) | hal ⁊ clæne <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Swer">Swer</ref> 7. 9 | <ref type="entry" target="entry:hand">hand</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> | healde oððe feormige <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 15a | hold ⁊ <ref type="entry" target="entry:getriewe">getrywe</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> | for læððe oððe feohfange <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 15,1 | gemet ⁊ gewiht <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> | <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:oft"><abbr>oft</abbr></ref> ⁊ <ref type="entry" target="entry:gelome">gelome</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> | geseah oððe gehyrde <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 6,1 | beweddod ⁊ forgifen <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 61 <hi rend="bold">I</hi>) <hi rend="bold"><hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Lateinisch"><abbr>Lat.</abbr></ref>:</hi></hi> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:vergleiche"><abbr>vgl</abbr></ref>.</hi> <ref type="entry" target="entry:annus">annus</ref> (mensis) et dies; dies 31; domus et curia; viridis et veneris ‖ <hi rend="italic">kirchliche <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref></hi> Iudicia Dei; Excommunicatio <hi rend="bold">K</hi>) <hi rend="bold"><hi rend="italic">Franz.:</hi></hi> burc u vile <ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 45 | ne cri ne force 28,2; senz siwte e senz cri 4 | pur curruz [u] pur hange u pur aveir 39,1 | duner gwage e truver plege 5,2. 6,1. 21 | a jur e a terme 21,1 | lu[in] e pref 44,2 | ne mort ne vif 45; vif ne mort 21,1a. 47,1</sense>
